0/pQQHU5LV4hRr9TbNFbRW4kQwci5.jpg","released":"2025-07-18T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"33 min"},{"id":"tt37025512:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"The Trombone","overview":"Maru and Mica infiltrate the home of Gussi’s widow. Later, new information about Romero forces the black widows to reevaluate their plans.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zUEaG5W0rVmd2ElRcDAlWmcssRI.jpg","released":"2025-07-25T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"31 min"},{"id":"tt37025512:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"The Idiots Club","overview":"While Maru confronts Maggie, Mica finally goes out to party. Later, the girls come up with a new plan to get Romero to sleep.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mKoORCrcIRdH5F20KJ1OatmUFnP.jpg","released":"2025-08-01T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"31 min"},{"id":"tt37025512:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Walter","overview":"The girls finally manage to put Romero to sleep, but troubles don’t seem to end, and the two decide to follow Nelly's lead.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4MxyeJiraPK2ARZ0zJ9sGaqzpvP.jpg","released":"2025-08-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"32 min"},{"id":"tt37025512:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"Cutting Corners","overview":"Worried about Maru, Pablo dares to leave the house and meets up with Cristian and the girls at the beauty center to look for his wife.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t9WKf2qbjbQEnirpKwJm14x2Xmf.jpg","released":"2025-08-15T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"37 min"}]}}